wifi-perf-random-persta2 ships the selected ns-3 script source and its local helper files.

Run it with:
  wifi-perf-random-persta2

The first run compiles the installed sources against the system ns-3
development package and caches the executable under:
  $XDG_CACHE_HOME/wifi-perf-random-persta2/build/

Install this package with apt so dependencies are pulled automatically:
  sudo apt install ./wifi-perf-random-persta2_1.0.0_amd64.deb
